+// b2270 FNL bit 4 (spec_fnl_1111 arm C, RC C136 form): every helper below is reached only with FNL_ON(4) read first.
+// Lock memory (Deep's exact puppet 01a1cfcd: the bot read the foe lock live only inside tribute/attack range, 11 body-turns in 596
